        <ExplanationTxt>CCOE FOUNDATION (501C3) CONTRACTS THE CCOE ASSOCIATION (501C6) TO EXECUTE ON ALL GRANTS. ALL GRANTS ARE MANAGED BY CCOE'S PRESIDENT &amp; CEO AND OVERSEEN BY THE BOARD. EACH GRANT IS GOVERNED BY AN APPROVED STATEMENT OF WORK, INCLUDED IN THE GRANT AGREEMENT WITH SPECIFIC DELIVERABLES, TIMELINES, REPORTING REQUIREMENTS AND INVOICING SCHEDULES. CCOE'S CFO AND ACCOUNTING FIRM, LEVITZACKS RECEIVE AND MANAGE ALL GRANT FUNDING ON BEHALF OF BOTH CCOE FOUNDATION AND CCOE ASSOCIATION, WHICH IS REVIEWED BY THE BOARD AND INCLUDED IN THE ANNUAL REPORT.</ExplanationTxt>
